  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "R01",
      "body": "Apply to maintenance changes that defer previously immediate document writes while preserving existing editor behavior. TASK: \"Coalesce edits using the existing trailing-task utility: after a 120 ms quiet\\ninterval, write only the latest text in that editing burst. Subsequent bursts\\nmust continue to save. Preserve the editor's other behavior and public interfaces.\"",
      "category": "applicability"
    },
    {
      "id": "R02",
      "body": "Route edits through the document's existing trailing task. Each additional edit restarts the quiet interval and replaces the pending value; verify no ordinary write before 120 ms of quiet and one write containing the latest text afterward. src/workflow.php: \"$this->pending=$value;\" and \"$this->handle=$this->env->schedule(function() { $this->flush(); }, $this->delay);\" BufferBank supplies \"new Trailing($env,120,function($text)use($env,$id){$env->write($id,$text);})\".",
      "category": "event_relation"
    },
    {
      "id": "R03",
      "body": "Clear consumed pending state before invoking work so subsequent bursts and synchronous callback activity can use the task again. src/workflow.php: \"$value=$this->pending; $this->pending=null; $this->handle=null;\\n        if ($value !== null) ($this->work)($value);\" Verify a later burst saves again and empty text remains valid.",
      "category": "verification"
    },
    {
      "id": "R04",
      "body": "Keep document persistence separate from view subscription cleanup. README.md: \"A workspace document buffer persists independently of the current view badge.\" docs/host-api.md: \"Document buffers are owned by a separate BufferBank service, while Badge owns only a live subscription.\" Check that open, close, and dispose preserve outgoing pending text before returning, consistent with preserving the original immediate-write behavior. Detaching the badge must not discard the persistent buffer.",
      "category": "preservation"
    },
    {
      "id": "R05",
      "body": "Bind deferred work to the originating document identity rather than whichever view is current when work executes. src/workflow.php: \"function($text)use($env,$id){$env->write($id,$text);}\" Verify switching documents cannot redirect the outgoing text to the incoming document.",
      "category": "event_relation"
    },
    {
      "id": "R06",
      "body": "Treat synchronous saves as reentry boundaries. docs/host-api.md: \"A store listener may call navigation synchronously.\" After persistence invokes listeners, a superseded outer navigation must not install its requested view. Preserve the existing request check in src/workflow.php: \"if(true&&$request!==$this->generation)return;\" Verify listener-triggered open or close remains authoritative.",
      "category": "event_relation"
    },
    {
      "id": "R07",
      "body": "Preserve public interfaces and event semantics. docs/host-api.md: \"createWorkspace offers open(id), edit(text), close(), dispose(); createSearchPreview offers query(text), hide().\" Also: \"All source identities/text and status payloads retain original semantics.\" Check deferred writes retain the original document ID, exact text, and store-generated event payload.",
      "category": "preservation"
    },
    {
      "id": "R08",
      "body": "Do not generalize persistent-document departure behavior to transient preview work or unrelated ownership policies. TASK: \"The adjacent search preview is outside this maintenance change.\" Preserve src/workflow.php: \"new Trailing($env,40,function($q)use($env){$env->output('preview',['query'=>$q]);});\" and \"function hide(){$this->task->cancel();}\" Preview retains its own delay, cancellation, and reuse behavior.",
      "category": "exclusion"
    }
  ],
